MID_LGA_3ISM_c02_Seo_m01: 
MID_LGA_3ISM_c02_Orh_m01: 
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_001: By the way, that spear of yours... I've been curious\nabout it ever since we first met.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_002: It seems familiar. I have a hunch about something.\nWould you mind if I examine it?
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_003: <NCA>"You may."
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_004: Thank you. I'll keep this short. Hmm...
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_005: Oh! Th-this— Well, I understand now.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_006: Now I know why it felt so familiar. The form has\nchanged, but it's something I once created.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_007: I see... It was broken... And it was patched up with\ntechnology from the People of the White Egg...
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_008: I have no idea how it ended up in your hands.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_009: Hmm...
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_010: I have a suggestion, Promised One. I'd like to\nrepair this in the right way.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_011: If you don't mind, I could restore this spear's true\npower in full.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_012: <ICA>"Please do."
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_013: <ICB>"No, thank you."
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_020: <ACA>Excellent. Then I'll get right to it. Wait there for\njust a bit.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_021: <ACA>Apologies for keeping you waiting. I think this turned\nout nicely, if I may say so myself. Go on—take it.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_014: <ACA>I'm not asking for anything in return. I'd just like to\nhelp you if I can.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_015: <ACA>Besides, I sense that it...wants this too.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_017: <ACB>I didn't expect you to turn me down. Well, I will\nrespect your decision, of course.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_018: <ACB>Simply talk to me about this in the future if you\never change your mind.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01_019: I hope and pray that your mission will find\ncomplete success.
MID_LGA_3ISM_c02_Cla_m01: <BLN>I've been curious...
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_001: So, have you decided that you'd like me to\nrepair the spear after all?
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_002: <ICA>"Please do."
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_003: <ICB>"No, thank you."
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_010: <ACA>Excellent. Then I'll get right to it. Wait there for\njust a bit.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_011: <ACA>Apologies for keeping you waiting. I think this turned\nout nicely, if I may say so myself. Go on—take it.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_004: <ACA>I'm not asking for anything in return. I'd just like to\nhelp you if I can.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_005: <ACA>Besides, I sense that it...wants this too.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_007: <ACB>I didn't expect you to turn me down. Well, I will\nrespect your decision, of course.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_008: <ACB>Simply talk to me about this in the future if you\never change your mind.
MID_LGV_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02_009: I hope and pray that your mission will find\ncomplete success.
MID_LGA_3ISM_c02_Cla_m02: <BLN>Changed your mind?